    <briefdescription>
<para>High-Resolution Power &amp; Precision Motion Control Driver. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Provides a vendor-agnostic, zero-allocation OS interface for sub-nanosecond PWM edge placement, complementary high-side/low-side gate driver control, hardware dead-time insertion, phase shifting, and emergency fault trips.</para>
<para>Usage: <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="structSYN__HRPWM" kindref="compound">SYN_HRPWM</ref><sp/>hrpwm;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="syn__hrpwm_8c_1a59d0219358233f00dbd20e4550655dbe" kindref="member">syn_hrpwm_init</ref>(&amp;hrpwm,<sp/>0,<sp/>500000);<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>500<sp/>kHz<sp/>switching<sp/>frequency</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="syn__hrpwm_8c_1a688d6f3e7c97144503f54d8be96781bc" kindref="member">syn_hrpwm_set_deadtime_ns</ref>(&amp;hrpwm,<sp/>100,<sp/>100);<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>100<sp/>ns<sp/>dead-time</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="syn__hrpwm_8c_1af74fcfb3c7f26e9633c7d1a70cc041c0" kindref="member">syn_hrpwm_set_duty_q16</ref>(&amp;hrpwm,<sp/><ref refid="syn__qmath_8h_1a6fb4c3fddeda3a2e145765b2e69af7fc" kindref="member">Q16_FROM_FLOAT</ref>(0.50f));<sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>50%<sp/>duty<sp/>cycle</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="syn__hrpwm_8c_1a2a44a2a0baea369dacba2610a126bd12" kindref="member">syn_hrpwm_enable</ref>(&amp;hrpwm,<sp/></highlight><highlight class="keyword">true</highlight><highlight class="normal">);</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
    </detaileddescription>
